THI YEHI SHAAM KE ZINDAA'N MEIN SAKINA KI FUGAA <br>
 DUM GHOOTA JAATA HAI GOODI MEIN UTHA LO AMMA<br>
<br>
1. KUCH SOJAHAEE NAHI DETA HAI ANDHERA ZINDAAN <br>
 HAAYE IS QAID MEIN JI PAYEGA KOI INSAAN<br>
 QAID HUM KO KIYA ZAALIM NE JO MISLE HAIWAAN <br>
 SAAS BHI AATI HAI MUSHKIL SE YEH KAISA HAI MAKAAN<br>
<br>
2. NEEND AATI MUJHE BABA KA JO MILTA SEENA <br>
 HOGAYA BAAD E PIDAR MERA TU MUSHKIL JEENA <br>
 AB TO BABA KE BINA HAI MUJHE AANSOO PEENA<br>
 KHOUFF KE MAR E KAHIN TAN SE NIKAL JAYE NA JAAN<br>
<br>
3. MERE AMMU MERI HAALAT PA ZARA RAHEM KAROO <br>
 NEEL GO HOGAYE RUKSAR E SAKINA DEKHO<br>
 AB SUNA E NAHIN DETI HAI SADA KYA TUMKO <br>
 MERI AWAAZ PE AAJAO CHACHA TUM HO KAHAN<br>
<br>
5. MEIN KHADI REHTI THI ROOTEY JO DAR E ZINDAAN PAR <br>
 KUCH PARINDEY BHI NAZAR AATE THE MUJH KO AKSAR <br>
 SHAAM HOOTI HAI TO WO LAOT KE JAATE HAI GHAR<br>
 KYA KABHI LAOT KE HUM JAYENGE HOOTA THA GUMAH<br>
<br>
6. JAB WOH KEHTI THI SOHAIL AAYE THEY BABA JISDUM <br>
 ROOTE THE SUN KE SAKINA KI FUGAA AHLE HARAM <br>
 QAID KHANE MEIN THA EK HASR SA BARPA PAIHAM<br>
 NANHE HAATOUN KO UTHA KAR JOH WOH KARTI THI BAYAN<br>
<br>
